{"about_the_game":"<strong>Sign In again.</strong><br>Remember a time before Facebook and Skype? When Windows XP was the next big thing and AIM was king. Relive that era with Emily is Away. Create a screenname and browse buddy infos in this chat-bot meets adventure game. Explore your relationship with Emily, a fellow high school student, in a branching narrative where you choose the outcome. And most importantly, change your text color to lime green so people know you're the coolest kid in school.<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>    Buddy icons, profiles and away messages.<br></li><li>    A dialogue decision-based branching narrative.<br></li><li>    Over an hour of nostalgia-inducing gameplay.<br></li><li>    Five chapters spanning five years of the main characters life.<br></li><li>    Computer sounds you hoped to never hear again!</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"2002","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/417860/3aef14d61e39affa3e53685f4ea99e835162c6cc.jpg"},{"name":"2003","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/417860/34240eb18a11b350d7806cb68ae0a83382c2a2d2.jpg"},{"name":"2004","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/417860/c202ab607a8dd949bb98230fec9bffb2184452dd.jpg"},{"name":"2005","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/417860/b37e1f1ddba048b120af2198c8017eb95814e47b.jpg"},{"name":"2006","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/417860/5bdbf9ce531090a1ef800ff4efd5dcc0939fc8ad.jpg"},{"name":"Write Some Fiction","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/417860/5ac36c4fc8d13f26ddb46e5881e312e5e14a25c7.jpg"},{"name":"Best Friends with Gabe","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/417860/a827e93c125645010a816646cff8c8fd63cc63c1.jpg"},{"name":"Stanley didn't unlock